id: pm-dg68kr
title: "Packing ships only the declarations an exported types entry reaches, restoring the artifact headroom PR 1680 exhausted"
description: "PR 1680's Gates (static) failed the base package-artifact profile: unpacked_size 20,025,292 > 20,000,000 and file_count 1,801 > 1,800. The run is 42309984232. One new emitted module, close-fields-retry, exhausted the 20,892 B and one-file headroom recorded on pm-998juj. Measured composition: 685 packed dist declarations, of which 212 (266,135 B) are unreachable from every exported types entry. The exports map refuses unexported subpaths, so no consumer can import those declarations. They are the CLI internals behind ./cli (whose public.d.ts is self-contained), the MCP servers, dist/cli.d.ts, and internal SDK and core modules. All 1,695 relative specifiers in dist declarations are .js module paths, and none use triple-slash references."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: "area:release",packaging,release-reliability
created_at: "2026-11-07T00:17:02.847Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-07T00:55:24.703Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-07T00:18:18.944Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-07T00:18:18.944Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "The publication tree leaves out every dist .d.ts that no exported types entry reaches and keeps every reachable one; the checkout keeps all declarations; the closure walk refuses the pack when an exported or referenced declaration is missing from the packlist or a relative specifier is not a .js module path; the packed smoke's strict TypeScript consumer imports every exported types entry, and a removed reachable declaration fails that compile; base and Sentry-injected package-artifact profiles pass with ceilings unchanged; npx and bunx packed smoke stays green; docs/RELEASING.md records the decision"
parent: pm-998juj
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Packing now ships only the dist declarations an exported types entry reaches. exportedDeclarationClosure (scripts/release/package-distribution.mjs) walks the 11 exported types entries and fails closed on unpacked or non-.js references. The staging loop leaves out the 212 unreachable declarations. The packed smoke's strict consumer compiles every exported types entry. Base headroom went from -25,149 B and -1 file to +240,986 B and +211 files, with ceilings unchanged."
expected_result: "A packed tarball under the committed 20,000,000 B and 1,800-file base ceilings, with every exported type still resolvable by a strict consumer"
actual_result: "Base 19,759,014 B / 1,589 files, Sentry-injected 20,037,538 <= 20,298,752; packed npx and bunx smoke passed with a strict consumer of all 12 type specifiers; removing a reachable declaration fails that compile (TS7016)"
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
